# "If another Desert was returned this way, surveil 1." Turn 3: the first Arid Archway returns the Plains, a land that is no
# Desert, so there is no surveil (graveyard still empty, no Arrange asked). Turn 5: the second Archway returns the first
# Archway, another Desert, and Bot1 surveils: the Island on top of the library goes to the graveyard. The first Archway is
# back in hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Arid Archway
Arid Archway
Swamp x4
Swamp
Swamp
Island
Swamp x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Arid Archway.Play
Bot1.Choose(Plains)
! Bot1.Arrange
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Arid Archway.Play
Bot1.Choose(Arid Archway#1)
Bot1.Arrange( | Island)

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Graveyard = Island
Bot1.Battlefield = Arid Archway
Bot1.Battlefield.Arid Archway.Tapped = true
Bot1.Hand = Arid Archway; Plains; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
